WEBVTT

01:31.520 --> 01:33.680
But there are pros and cons.

01:35.120 --> 01:38.160
The clan system of the Yang family
has lasted so long

01:38.880 --> 01:41.600
that it has begun to slow down
and corrupt.

01:42.480 --> 01:45.760
Now, compared to taking money
from outsiders,

01:45.840 --> 01:48.600
the uncles seem more willing
to take money from their relatives.

01:50.640 --> 01:52.320
How dare you tell me all this?

01:54.120 --> 01:55.400
Aren't you afraid I'll punish you?

01:56.720 --> 01:59.400
Isn't this exactly
what you wanted me to see?

02:05.840 --> 02:07.440
When did you find out?

02:08.280 --> 02:10.400
You knew there would be a dispute
with the elders

02:10.479 --> 02:12.080
if I attended the banquet,

02:12.600 --> 02:14.240
but you still let me go.

02:14.840 --> 02:17.000
You blamed me for opposing Second Uncle,

02:17.520 --> 02:18.760
yet gave me the shop

02:18.840 --> 02:20.920
and gave me the foundation
to confront him.

02:22.080 --> 02:23.960
And through the sample brocade incident,

02:24.040 --> 02:26.960
you made me see the flaws
in the Yang family's system.

02:27.040 --> 02:28.520
Even Jin Xiu,

02:28.600 --> 02:30.200
that particularly well-mannered maid,

02:30.280 --> 02:33.360
was deliberately arranged by you,
wasn't it?

02:34.400 --> 02:35.840
So,

02:36.360 --> 02:38.160
what do you think

02:39.480 --> 02:40.920
I arranged all of this for?

02:41.880 --> 02:43.120
You need me,

02:43.960 --> 02:45.440
like a knife,

02:45.960 --> 02:47.320
to cut through the corruption

02:47.880 --> 02:49.200
and rebuild the Yang family.

02:56.440 --> 02:57.760
Since you invited me,

02:58.280 --> 02:59.960
you must have a plan.

03:00.840 --> 03:02.640
To change the Yang family,

03:02.720 --> 03:04.240
we first need to understand

03:04.320 --> 03:07.160
what is trapping the Yang family.

03:20.000 --> 03:22.200
Uncles! You have arrived early.

03:22.720 --> 03:24.040
I came late.

03:24.120 --> 03:25.080
Well then,

03:25.160 --> 03:28.240
I'll start by punishing myself
with a drink.

03:30.000 --> 03:31.760
Good!

03:31.840 --> 03:32.800
See?

03:34.000 --> 03:34.880
What did I say?

03:34.960 --> 03:36.360
He wouldn't be wearing official attire!

03:36.440 --> 03:37.600
So, the one who comes today

03:37.680 --> 03:39.560
is our nephew, Yang Jinglan,

03:39.640 --> 03:40.880
not Inspector Yang.

03:44.160 --> 03:45.200
Jinglan,

03:45.720 --> 03:47.240
you've been away for years,

03:47.760 --> 03:49.320
and you've forgotten the rules.

03:49.400 --> 03:50.360
How could you send someone

03:50.440 --> 03:53.040
to inspect our Yang family's accounts?

03:53.120 --> 03:57.240
But considering you've been away
for so many years,

03:57.320 --> 03:58.320
we won't hold it against you

03:58.400 --> 04:00.400
or question you at the ancestral hall.

04:01.160 --> 04:03.480
Let's clear the air here

04:03.560 --> 04:06.160
at the dinner table.

04:06.240 --> 04:08.000
Oh,

04:08.520 --> 04:11.680
what rule of our family
have I broken by inspecting the accounts?

04:12.880 --> 04:15.200
The Yang family rule, Article 34.

04:15.280 --> 04:16.959
No in-fighting within the family.

04:17.040 --> 04:19.160
No mixing of insiders and outsiders.

04:19.240 --> 04:22.680
No short-sighted actions
that harm long-term interests.

04:22.760 --> 04:25.160
The Yang family rule, Article 41.

04:25.240 --> 04:26.920
All Yang family shops,

04:27.000 --> 04:29.920
all products, personnel, and accounts

04:30.000 --> 04:32.480
are under the management of the steward.

04:32.560 --> 04:35.360
No private circulation

04:35.440 --> 04:37.240
or probing into secrets.

04:38.280 --> 04:40.360
Fifth Uncle,
you really have a good memory,

04:40.440 --> 04:42.320
but I didn't understand a word of it.

04:42.400 --> 04:45.320
Perhaps, Second Uncle,
you can help me clarify?

04:45.400 --> 04:46.720
Yang Jinglan!

04:47.880 --> 04:49.920
Stop pretending to be confused.

04:50.000 --> 04:53.200
Today, we uncles invited you here
to give you face.

04:53.800 --> 04:55.360
If you don't want this face,

04:55.440 --> 04:56.800
we'll question you at the ancestral hall!

04:57.560 --> 05:00.120
I'll ask my good brother and sister-in-law

05:00.200 --> 05:03.720
how they plan to punish you,
this ungrateful child.

05:03.800 --> 05:05.000
I'll let them teach you

05:05.080 --> 05:07.000
what the Yang family's rules really mean!

05:07.600 --> 05:09.480
Clan members aren't scary,

05:09.560 --> 05:12.320
but what's tricky
is the knife in their hands,

05:12.400 --> 05:14.160
the Yang family's rules.

05:15.320 --> 05:17.520
So, to change the Yang family,
the best method

05:18.160 --> 05:21.080
is to establish new rules and regulations

05:21.160 --> 05:24.960
and return power
to proper and reasonable rules

05:25.040 --> 05:28.360
rather than relying on seniority
and bloodlines.

05:31.200 --> 05:32.320
Since you uncles

05:32.400 --> 05:34.080
have already said this much,

05:34.160 --> 05:35.800
I'll also share my thoughts with everyone.

05:36.800 --> 05:39.040
I inspected the accounts
because I have a personal interest.

05:40.520 --> 05:41.840
The Crown Prince

05:41.920 --> 05:43.680
wants to secretly buy some Shu brocade.

05:44.440 --> 05:45.440
When the Crown Prince buys things,

05:46.080 --> 05:47.440
even in private,

05:47.520 --> 05:50.120
he still needs to investigate
the source thoroughly.

05:50.200 --> 05:51.920
I just happen to be in Yizhou,

05:52.000 --> 05:54.200
so the Crown Prince entrusted me

05:54.280 --> 05:56.160
with this inspection task.

05:57.320 --> 05:58.600
Now, which family should I choose?

06:01.480 --> 06:04.200
Jinglan,
if you really have this intention,

06:04.280 --> 06:05.520
why not just say it directly?

06:05.600 --> 06:07.720
How should I say it? What should I say?

06:07.800 --> 06:09.600
Should I say
I'm a member of the Yang family,

06:09.680 --> 06:11.600
so they should just buy Yang's brocade?

06:11.680 --> 06:12.600
That doesn't seem appropriate.

06:13.960 --> 06:16.760
Actually,
I've already thought of an excuse.

06:17.280 --> 06:19.560
I'll tell the Crown Prince

06:19.640 --> 06:21.440
that I'm not on good terms
with the Yang family,

06:21.520 --> 06:23.680
that the inspection
is just to vent my personal grievances.

06:23.760 --> 06:25.000
But once we check,

06:25.080 --> 06:26.320
we find everything seems fine,

06:26.400 --> 06:27.320
and the brocade is good.

06:28.000 --> 06:30.200
Then, since I value family ties,

06:30.280 --> 06:31.440
I'll naturally recommend
our Yang's brocade.

06:33.360 --> 06:34.520
If that's the case,

06:35.040 --> 06:37.120
then continue with your plan.

06:38.880 --> 06:40.160
No, that's not possible.

06:40.240 --> 06:41.800
The Yang family has its rules.

06:42.320 --> 06:44.280
I'm not qualified to inspect.

06:45.480 --> 06:48.960
Jinglan, the Crown Prince doesn't know
the Yang family's rules after all.

06:51.120 --> 06:52.360
He's your Eleventh Uncle.

06:53.640 --> 06:54.840
Eleventh Uncle,

06:54.920 --> 06:56.280
you've never been in office,

06:56.360 --> 06:58.040
so, naturally, you don't understand.

06:58.560 --> 07:01.760
This matter will need to be reviewed.

07:01.840 --> 07:03.000
When the time comes,

07:03.600 --> 07:05.280
someone from Chang'an will come down
to cross-check,

07:05.360 --> 07:07.520
and once they know about this rule
of the Yang family,

07:07.600 --> 07:09.000
they'll ask

07:11.200 --> 07:12.560
- and say…
- You…

07:12.640 --> 07:14.960
"You say you've inspected
the Yang family's shop,

07:15.040 --> 07:16.560
but did the Yang family's rules
allow you to inspect?"

07:17.840 --> 07:19.200
I…

07:19.280 --> 07:21.800
"You didn't check at all,
yet falsely reported that you did,

07:21.880 --> 07:25.600
or did the Yang family's rules change?"

07:25.680 --> 07:26.880
Jinglan,

07:26.960 --> 07:30.120
as long as the rules change, it will…

07:30.800 --> 07:31.640
Just kidding.

07:31.720 --> 07:33.560
How could the Yang family's rules change?

07:34.880 --> 07:36.080
If you're sure

07:36.160 --> 07:37.920
that the Crown Prince

07:38.000 --> 07:39.240
will definitely buy Yang's brocade…

07:39.320 --> 07:41.800
As long as no family has any issues.

07:43.040 --> 07:45.120
- Fine.
- Fifth Brother, what do you mean by that?

07:46.640 --> 07:47.840
Everyone,

07:47.920 --> 07:51.560
I think since Jinglan is doing this
for the Yang family's good,

07:51.640 --> 07:54.720
then we must do our part
to protect the Yang family's reputation.

07:55.440 --> 07:56.600
I suggest

07:56.680 --> 07:59.480
we add another clause

07:59.560 --> 08:00.680
to the 41st rule.

08:01.800 --> 08:06.680
If mutual investigation
benefits the Yang family,

08:06.760 --> 08:09.400
then we can discuss it as needed.

08:10.360 --> 08:11.480
What do you think?

08:11.560 --> 08:12.600
It's not possible!

08:12.680 --> 08:14.840
That's a rule passed down
from our ancestors,

08:14.920 --> 08:15.840
and it cannot be changed!

08:17.120 --> 08:17.960
Fifth Uncle,

08:18.720 --> 08:22.120
I seem to recall
that our family has a rule,

08:22.200 --> 08:23.360
something like,

08:23.440 --> 08:27.080
"If opinions differ,

08:27.160 --> 08:29.520
the minority must follow the majority."

08:30.360 --> 08:32.000
Yes, there is such a rule!

08:33.320 --> 08:34.240
Here,

08:35.480 --> 08:36.919
if you agree to add one more clause,

08:37.000 --> 08:39.320
let's all drink to this.

08:40.240 --> 08:41.080
All right.

08:48.000 --> 08:48.840
Second Uncle.

08:48.920 --> 08:50.880
Second Brother!

08:55.720 --> 08:58.560
See? Doesn't it seem like
the Yang family is united?

08:58.640 --> 09:01.040
Then let's change the rule.

09:01.120 --> 09:02.920
- Let's change it!
- Change it!

09:03.000 --> 09:04.080
Let's change it!

09:05.480 --> 09:08.440
You see, the rules
can be changed eventually.

09:08.520 --> 09:10.600
But how can you be sure

09:10.680 --> 09:13.880
that your new rules will be better
than the old ones?

09:15.240 --> 09:16.080
I'm not sure,

09:17.280 --> 09:18.960
that's why we need to try.

09:19.640 --> 09:23.520
I've already organized
the Yang family's brocade-related rules,

09:23.600 --> 09:25.160
and I'll go through them with everyone.

09:25.760 --> 09:27.840
We will prioritize revising and improving

09:27.920 --> 09:29.760
the three most important ones.

09:29.840 --> 09:31.080
These will be implemented first
in the Bloom Society

09:31.160 --> 09:32.000
and Ji's Brocade Workshop.

09:32.080 --> 09:34.960
I want you to witness this with us, Madam.

09:36.280 --> 09:39.240
So, you're not trying
to change the Yang family,

09:39.320 --> 09:40.200
but the brocade industry.

09:41.320 --> 09:42.560
What I want to reform

09:42.640 --> 09:44.800
are all the unreasonable rules.

09:45.800 --> 09:48.560
If this attempt is successful,

09:48.640 --> 09:51.120
would you allow me to try it
in the Yang family as well?

09:52.560 --> 09:53.760
Or perhaps,

09:53.840 --> 09:56.720
would you dare to take a gamble?

10:01.160 --> 10:02.000
Jin Xin.

10:03.560 --> 10:05.400
- Madam.
- Bring the wine.

10:07.960 --> 10:09.840
I want to have a good drink

10:10.360 --> 10:11.560
with my business partner.

10:16.760 --> 10:22.120
JI'S BROCADE WORKSHOP IS HIRING WEAVERS

10:30.640 --> 10:31.520
Everyone,

10:32.200 --> 10:34.040
you needn't worry about us
faking anything.

10:34.120 --> 10:36.160
These terms will all be written
into the contract.

10:36.240 --> 10:38.440
Those who wish to work
at Ji's Brocade Workshop,

10:38.960 --> 10:40.040
please come inside to sign the contract.

10:56.800 --> 10:59.160
There's been a lot of talk lately
about your new rules.

10:59.800 --> 11:01.120
They say they want to teach you a lesson.

11:01.200 --> 11:02.920
But no one has dared to come forward yet.

11:04.800 --> 11:05.960
They're waiting.

11:07.080 --> 11:10.560
In their eyes,
I have always been rebellious,

11:10.640 --> 11:11.720
but only after profit.

11:12.320 --> 11:14.000
Some people are just waiting to see

11:14.080 --> 11:16.160
if this really has any benefits.

11:16.800 --> 11:17.920
If it does,

11:18.000 --> 11:19.520
they'll use it sooner or later.

11:20.040 --> 11:21.280
For businessmen,

11:21.360 --> 11:23.440
profit is always the top priority.

11:24.680 --> 11:25.720
And then, some people

11:26.760 --> 11:28.240
are probably waiting
for the Yang family clan

11:28.320 --> 11:29.400
to teach me a lesson.

11:40.080 --> 11:41.520
You look really good.

11:44.360 --> 11:45.760
But who are you dressing up for?

11:50.040 --> 11:51.920
Women dress up
to please those who love them.

11:52.600 --> 11:54.440
This makeup

11:54.960 --> 11:56.880
is naturally for you to see.

11:56.960 --> 11:59.240
What if I didn't come today?

12:00.240 --> 12:02.760
So, I wait here every day,

12:04.240 --> 12:05.840
thinking that one day,

12:06.360 --> 12:08.200
you will need me.

12:10.000 --> 12:11.760
For example, during festivals.

12:11.840 --> 12:13.120
Sometimes it's necessary

12:13.200 --> 12:15.880
for me, the Lady Zhao,
to make an appearance.

12:17.680 --> 12:19.400
Or, for example,

12:20.240 --> 12:21.640
when my father suddenly remembers me

12:22.680 --> 12:23.880
and wants to see me.

12:25.560 --> 12:26.840
You Niu family members

12:26.920 --> 12:28.440
truly have strong willpower.

12:29.200 --> 12:30.800
Even in such adversity,

12:30.880 --> 12:33.160
you can endure and bide your time.

12:44.360 --> 12:46.440
Now that you have finally agreed
to meet me,

12:47.840 --> 12:49.240
it must be for something important.

12:50.320 --> 12:52.240
I've heard that you stayed
in Chang'an for a while

12:52.320 --> 12:54.240
and made many influential friends.

12:56.960 --> 12:59.360
Are you planning to bring
the Zhao family's business

12:59.440 --> 13:00.440
to Chang'an?

13:04.040 --> 13:06.320
Chang'an is actually a place
that brings me sorrow.

13:08.040 --> 13:09.920
My second husband

13:10.000 --> 13:11.240
died there.

13:14.480 --> 13:15.360
Naturally,

13:16.040 --> 13:18.680
I'm willing to serve faithfully,

13:19.840 --> 13:21.360
but…

13:21.440 --> 13:22.960
I know what you're thinking.

13:23.880 --> 13:25.080
Yu Yuan is not dead.

13:26.680 --> 13:27.960
If I could sell her,

13:28.040 --> 13:29.560
I can definitely buy her back.

13:32.560 --> 13:34.200
If you continue to be stubborn,

13:35.680 --> 13:37.640
you will eventually learn her fate.

13:46.080 --> 13:46.960
Yu Yuan,

13:48.560 --> 13:50.320
I will definitely save you.

13:57.440 --> 13:59.480
Since you left home,

13:59.560 --> 14:01.080
your father has been drawing
your portrait every year

14:01.680 --> 14:03.280
based on his imagination

14:04.040 --> 14:06.000
and sending people to look for you.

14:06.920 --> 14:09.960
Later, when the Yang family
went on trade journeys,

14:10.040 --> 14:12.000
it was always your father
leading the team.

14:12.520 --> 14:14.160
He hoped to encounter you.

14:15.320 --> 14:17.720
Every year, he copied scriptures
and prayed for your safety.

14:17.800 --> 14:19.360
Even if you didn't return,

14:19.440 --> 14:20.880
he still wanted you to be safe.

14:23.000 --> 14:26.160
Madam is not showing you this
to persuade you.

14:26.760 --> 14:28.680
She just wants to tell you

14:28.760 --> 14:31.320
that those who have passed are gone,

14:31.920 --> 14:33.200
and the living

14:33.840 --> 14:35.920
should cherish those in front of them,

14:36.000 --> 14:37.720
so they won't regret it later.

14:41.360 --> 14:43.200
I'm just here to deliver a message.

14:44.200 --> 14:45.800
Whatever decision you make,
I'll support you.

14:50.560 --> 14:51.960
Thank you, dear.

15:09.240 --> 15:11.480
No matter what decision I make,
you'd support me?

15:13.800 --> 15:14.640
Good.

15:17.240 --> 15:18.080
Come on.

15:23.000 --> 15:25.800
Yang Jinglan, what are you doing?
Put me down!

15:25.880 --> 15:26.920
I still have things to do!

15:27.000 --> 15:28.080
I have things to do too.

15:28.600 --> 15:29.920
I have important matters.

15:30.000 --> 15:31.040
I have important matters too.

15:45.200 --> 15:47.200
This road is hard to travel.
Watch your step.

15:51.880 --> 15:53.320
Yang Jinglan, let me tell you.

15:53.840 --> 15:56.720
Although only three rules
have been changed so far,

15:56.800 --> 15:58.520
my brother and Mr. Yu said

15:58.600 --> 16:00.960
the workers are indeed more motivated,

16:01.040 --> 16:02.280
and things are getting done faster.

16:02.360 --> 16:04.560
But the reward and punishment system

16:04.640 --> 16:07.400
has also caused some jealousy
among the workers,

16:07.480 --> 16:08.760
and it still needs improvement.

16:09.440 --> 16:11.480
No rush. We'll take it slow.

16:15.840 --> 16:16.960
By the way,

16:17.040 --> 16:19.040
last time you told the clan

16:19.120 --> 16:21.000
that the Crown Prince
wanted to buy Yang's brocade.

16:21.080 --> 16:22.240
If the Crown Prince finds out,

16:22.320 --> 16:23.960
won't he punish you?

16:24.040 --> 16:24.880
No, he won't.

16:25.400 --> 16:27.200
As long as I don't break the law
or the public's trust,

16:28.080 --> 16:29.560
he'll let me use his name.

16:32.120 --> 16:33.840
But this method can't be used too often.

16:33.920 --> 16:36.480
We must rely on our own rules soon.

16:40.920 --> 16:42.560
Are you tired? I'll carry you.

16:44.560 --> 16:45.600
Okay.

16:48.640 --> 16:49.480
Come on.

16:50.520 --> 16:51.760
No need.

16:54.240 --> 16:56.000
This is my first time
coming to see Ta Xue.

16:56.080 --> 16:56.920
I need to show sincerity.

16:57.600 --> 16:59.320
And I also need to get used to it

16:59.400 --> 17:01.360
because I'll come here with you often.

17:03.040 --> 17:03.880
Fine.

17:07.119 --> 17:08.160
Let's go.

17:08.800 --> 17:09.640
Take care.

17:21.520 --> 17:22.480
Ta Xue,

17:23.000 --> 17:24.400
I'm sorry.

17:24.480 --> 17:26.200
I finally had time to come see you today.

17:26.280 --> 17:27.920
TA XUE'S GRAVE

17:28.800 --> 17:30.720
Thank you for traveling thousands of miles

17:30.800 --> 17:32.240
to bring him back and save me.

17:32.320 --> 17:34.760
ALL ANIMALS SHOWN SERVE STORY NEEDS ONLY
NO HARM CAME TO THEM DURING FILMING

17:36.600 --> 17:38.880
I heard this is the kind of leaf
you liked to eat the most.

17:40.040 --> 17:41.360
This time, please make do with these.

17:41.960 --> 17:43.040
When I come again,

17:43.120 --> 17:45.760
I'll plant a tree
like this nearby for you,

17:45.840 --> 17:48.400
so that you can eat
fresh leaves every day.

17:57.640 --> 17:58.880
How is it, buddy?

17:59.640 --> 18:00.840
She's a good person, isn't she?

18:01.680 --> 18:03.280
Not to mention thousands of miles,

18:03.360 --> 18:04.880
even if it's millions of miles,

18:04.960 --> 18:06.720
it's worth coming back to marry her.

18:11.480 --> 18:13.640
The picture I promised to draw for you
has already been done.

18:13.720 --> 18:15.120
Now, take a good look at it.

18:15.640 --> 18:16.560
See

18:17.080 --> 18:18.440
if I missed anything.

18:24.280 --> 18:26.600
These are all the places you and Ta Xue
have been together?

18:28.080 --> 18:29.000
That's right.

18:30.040 --> 18:32.480
Chang'an, Jiangnan,

18:32.560 --> 18:33.960
the Northern Desert,

18:34.480 --> 18:35.520
and the coastline…

18:41.400 --> 18:44.360
No wonder you are so calm
and composed now.

18:44.880 --> 18:47.600
The path you've walked
has become a part of you.

18:48.480 --> 18:49.480
In the future, I'll take you along.

18:55.080 --> 18:57.640
I also want to bring
my Shu brocade with me.

18:57.720 --> 18:59.760
I want the whole world to know its beauty.

19:00.720 --> 19:03.080
I want to sell it to Jiangnan,

19:03.840 --> 19:05.000
sell it to the Northern Desert,

19:05.720 --> 19:06.960
sell it to Tibet,

19:07.480 --> 19:08.720
sell it to India,

19:08.800 --> 19:09.760
sell it to Nanzhao,

19:09.840 --> 19:12.600
sell it everywhere I can reach!

19:14.360 --> 19:15.200
Dear,

19:15.960 --> 19:16.880
you even want to sell it to Nanzhao?

19:16.960 --> 19:18.200
Sure.

19:18.720 --> 19:20.960
I've seen foreign merchants in Fan City.

19:21.040 --> 19:23.200
They really love Shu brocade,

19:23.280 --> 19:25.520
and they love everything
from Tang, from Yizhou.

19:26.040 --> 19:28.040
I feel honored by that.

19:30.640 --> 19:32.640
If trade routes are opened in the future

19:32.720 --> 19:35.600
and formal and mature trade relations
are established,

19:35.680 --> 19:37.640
private transactions will decrease.

19:38.680 --> 19:40.240
No one

19:40.320 --> 19:41.960
will be innocently harmed anymore.

19:45.760 --> 19:46.600
And also,

19:47.120 --> 19:48.600
the beauty of Shu brocade

19:48.680 --> 19:50.400
should not be confined to a small place.

19:54.040 --> 19:55.000
Yang Jinglan,

19:55.520 --> 19:58.000
once I help Madam reform the Yang family,

19:58.080 --> 19:59.840
I will take the Shu brocade out with me.

20:00.360 --> 20:01.960
I want to see the world

20:02.480 --> 20:04.760
and let the world see me.

20:06.040 --> 20:07.440
Alright, then when the time comes,

20:07.520 --> 20:09.520
I'll accompany you

20:09.600 --> 20:11.120
to see the world

20:11.200 --> 20:13.400
and let the world see you.

20:24.160 --> 20:27.120
CHANG'AN

20:28.160 --> 20:32.120
CROWDS OF GUESTS COME LIKE CLOUDS

20:40.800 --> 20:42.160
Long time no see,

20:42.240 --> 20:45.080
yet you still remember me

20:45.640 --> 20:47.920
and are willing to grace me
with your presence.

20:49.320 --> 20:50.280
I'll raise a glass to all of you.

20:52.600 --> 20:53.720
Especially you, Mrs. Zheng,

20:54.480 --> 20:57.400
I'm grateful for the care
you showed me back then.

20:58.400 --> 21:00.800
The one sitting in the center
is Mrs. Zheng.

21:01.400 --> 21:03.960
Her mother is close to several princesses,

21:04.040 --> 21:06.360
and the princesses trust her judgment.

21:07.240 --> 21:08.440
She and her mother take pride

21:08.520 --> 21:10.480
in influencing the fashion
of Chang'an's women.

21:10.560 --> 21:12.080
Apart from her,

21:12.160 --> 21:14.040
all the ladies invited to this banquet

21:14.120 --> 21:16.440
are the prominent and respectable women

21:16.520 --> 21:18.040
in Chang'an.

21:19.160 --> 21:20.960
You're also a woman of misfortune.

21:21.040 --> 21:23.760
- You didn't have a good life in Chang'an.
- Look at these women.

21:24.480 --> 21:25.640
They seem warm,

21:25.720 --> 21:27.520
but in reality,
they're here to watch her downfall.

21:28.320 --> 21:29.880
They all want to see

21:29.960 --> 21:32.040
how fallen Niu Wuniang is now.

21:32.120 --> 21:33.680
If I'd known earlier,
I would've stopped you.

21:33.760 --> 21:35.880
What's a merchant compared to you?

21:36.400 --> 21:38.880
Even if this is your third marriage,

21:38.960 --> 21:41.440
he doesn't deserve a noble lady like you.

21:41.520 --> 21:43.400
Indeed.

21:43.480 --> 21:44.680
He didn't hit you, did he?

21:45.640 --> 21:46.960
What are you saying?

21:47.040 --> 21:49.040
I told you not to bring up her sad past.

21:53.200 --> 21:54.200
It's fine.

21:54.800 --> 21:56.680
You are just concerned about me.

21:57.640 --> 21:59.960
My current husband treats me very well.

22:00.720 --> 22:02.000
He is the Brocade Master of Yizhou,

22:02.840 --> 22:05.960
and his Zhao family
is a prominent brocade-dyeing family.

22:06.680 --> 22:09.400
Shu brocade? The Zhao family?

22:10.000 --> 22:13.440
My dear, were you fooled?

22:14.640 --> 22:16.920
The fine clothes and goods
of the nobles in Chang'an

22:17.000 --> 22:18.680
are all made from Yang's brocade.

22:18.760 --> 22:21.240
When have you ever heard
of Zhao's brocade?

22:21.840 --> 22:23.160
Indeed.

22:23.680 --> 22:25.200
Our family's matriarch

22:25.280 --> 22:27.920
has always bought Yang's brocade.

22:28.000 --> 22:30.160
Mrs. Zheng's outfit today is made

22:30.240 --> 22:31.760
from Yang's brocade.

22:31.840 --> 22:35.120
That's truly worth its weight in gold.

22:35.800 --> 22:37.600
Well, this was a gift from my husband.

22:37.680 --> 22:39.080
I couldn't bear to buy it myself.

22:41.480 --> 22:44.280
Why are you bringing up this
in front of Wuniang?

22:45.520 --> 22:48.080
Wuniang, don't be too upset.

22:49.480 --> 22:52.280
Although my outfit
is more valuable than yours,

22:52.880 --> 22:55.560
that doesn't mean
your husband doesn't love you.

22:55.640 --> 22:57.280
It's just that the Yang's brocade

22:58.200 --> 23:00.480
really has no equal.

23:01.200 --> 23:02.120
No,

23:02.200 --> 23:05.920
what I meant was,
the Zhao's brocade is also fine.

23:14.560 --> 23:16.600
- Stop!
- How dare you!

23:16.680 --> 23:17.640
Dancers like you

23:17.720 --> 23:20.560
dares to wear the same clothes
as the noble ladies?

23:24.320 --> 23:25.600
Since we're performing dances
for you ladies today,

23:26.200 --> 23:28.680
we've specially changed
into new dance outfits.

23:28.760 --> 23:31.240
We didn't mean to offend you, Madam.
Please forgive us!

23:32.520 --> 23:35.560
It seems not only does Mrs. Zheng
love the Yang's brocade,

23:36.480 --> 23:38.800
but even the songstress
and dancers in Chang'an

23:38.880 --> 23:40.120
really love it too.

23:41.160 --> 23:43.640
You've deliberately set this up
to embarrass me!

23:44.280 --> 23:46.000
That's ridiculous.

23:46.080 --> 23:48.560
Yang's brocade is everywhere
in the streets now.

23:49.400 --> 23:51.120
How could I have deliberately done this?

23:51.200 --> 23:52.320
That's true.

23:52.400 --> 23:54.880
Mrs. Zheng, this Yang's brocade
with the phoenix pattern

23:54.960 --> 23:57.040
is only ten wen per inch
on the market now.

23:57.120 --> 23:58.160
Only ten wen?

23:58.240 --> 24:00.760
Isn't that the price of regular fabric?

24:00.840 --> 24:02.000
Sir,

24:02.800 --> 24:05.600
that's Shu brocade,
which is worth its weight in gold!

24:05.680 --> 24:07.600
Should we really do this?

24:09.400 --> 24:11.200
The Yang family's reputation in Chang'an

24:11.280 --> 24:12.440
has been built up over time.

24:12.520 --> 24:13.440
It wasn't achieved overnight.

24:14.280 --> 24:15.320
Let me ask you.

24:15.960 --> 24:17.040
Would you trade 50 rolls of brocade

24:17.120 --> 24:19.880
for the Yang family's years of foundation

24:19.960 --> 24:21.120
and reputation?

24:21.800 --> 24:22.960
Do you think it's worth it or not?

24:24.600 --> 24:25.920
I have a narrow view.

24:26.000 --> 24:27.600
You have deeper foresight, sir.

24:29.560 --> 24:31.360
You may not know,

24:31.440 --> 24:34.640
but ever since the Yang family
lost the title of Brocade Master,

24:34.720 --> 24:36.440
to recover from the losses,

24:36.520 --> 24:38.400
they had to sell at low prices

24:38.480 --> 24:39.400
and mass-produce.

24:41.920 --> 24:43.320
If you

24:43.400 --> 24:46.600
still take pride in Yang's brocade,

24:47.360 --> 24:48.520
you'll find yourself

24:48.600 --> 24:51.960
facing many troublesome issues
in the future.

24:52.040 --> 24:52.880
You…

24:59.760 --> 25:03.440
But Zhao's brocade is different.

25:04.320 --> 25:06.520
The Zhao family
is the Brocade Master of Yizhou.

25:06.600 --> 25:08.320
We focus on excellence,

25:08.840 --> 25:11.840
tailoring each piece
for the nobility of Chang'an.

25:13.240 --> 25:14.480
Each batch of brocade

25:14.560 --> 25:18.840
is woven by the best artisans
in the Zhao family.

25:19.960 --> 25:22.400
From raw silk to the finished brocade,

25:22.480 --> 25:24.520
all overseen by my husband personally.

25:27.040 --> 25:28.440
Most importantly,

25:29.040 --> 25:30.360
Zhao's brocade

25:30.440 --> 25:33.920
can only be worn by those worthy of it.

25:37.040 --> 25:38.480
In my view,

25:39.120 --> 25:42.560
Zhao's brocade
is superior to Yang's brocade.

25:43.840 --> 25:45.280
What do you think?

25:46.560 --> 25:48.840
I think it's really quite good.

25:51.000 --> 25:54.800
Since Wuniang has brought us
such beautiful Shu brocade,

25:55.320 --> 25:57.240
let's all raise a toast to Wuniang.

25:57.320 --> 25:58.280
Come on!

25:58.360 --> 25:59.800
Let's raise a toast to Wuniang.

26:31.920 --> 26:34.000
Mrs. Zheng
knew I'd been scheming against her.

26:35.960 --> 26:37.360
She was willing to cooperate

26:37.960 --> 26:40.520
because every time I use her,

26:40.600 --> 26:42.640
she gets great benefits.

26:44.600 --> 26:45.720
So,

26:45.800 --> 26:48.360
you must bring her a heavy gift.

26:49.840 --> 26:51.520
If she accepts it,

26:51.600 --> 26:53.080
then it's settled.

26:54.040 --> 26:55.200
If she can get her mother

26:55.280 --> 26:57.560
to say a few words
in front of the princess,

26:59.560 --> 27:01.160
the Yang family is finished.

27:06.440 --> 27:07.520
Stop drinking.

27:09.440 --> 27:10.600
Take Madam back to rest.

27:10.680 --> 27:11.880
Yes.

27:12.680 --> 27:13.800
No need.

27:14.400 --> 27:15.760
I want to sit for a while longer.

27:27.080 --> 27:30.600
Back then, Yu Yuan and I

27:31.200 --> 27:33.480
loved visiting this inn.

27:35.520 --> 27:38.560
Every time my beast of a husband beat me,

27:40.080 --> 27:41.400
the two of us

27:41.480 --> 27:43.520
would run here for a big feast.

27:46.560 --> 27:48.080
We'd eat

27:49.040 --> 27:50.400
and laugh.

27:52.760 --> 27:54.160
No one was allowed to cry.

28:09.200 --> 28:10.760
Since the day I was born,

28:12.000 --> 28:14.240
I've never felt a shred of love.

28:16.760 --> 28:18.320
My mother doesn't acknowledge me.

28:19.720 --> 28:22.080
My father despises me because I'm a girl.

28:23.680 --> 28:25.400
He only wanted to marry me off

28:25.920 --> 28:27.440
to gain benefits for himself.

28:30.760 --> 28:33.160
My husband doesn't even treat me
like a human.

28:37.960 --> 28:39.880
Only Yu Yuan's presence

28:40.560 --> 28:44.040
made me feel warmth and love.

28:45.960 --> 28:48.080
Now that Yu Yuan is no longer by my side,

28:50.560 --> 28:51.760
my life feels

28:54.560 --> 28:56.280
like it's fallen into an abyss again.

29:01.800 --> 29:02.920
Zhao Xiuyuan,

29:05.240 --> 29:06.200
I'm tired.

29:12.040 --> 29:14.160
Once this matter is over,

29:16.440 --> 29:18.120
return Yu Yuan to me,

29:21.600 --> 29:23.040
and we'll be square.

29:24.760 --> 29:25.680
Fine.

29:32.640 --> 29:38.120
YIZHOU

29:45.160 --> 29:47.640
Didn't I send word asking you
to stay a few more days at Ji's house

29:47.720 --> 29:48.640
and come back later?

29:49.640 --> 29:51.920
Mr. Jingshan,
we are also part of the Yang family.

29:52.000 --> 29:53.720
We want to solve the problems
in Chang'an too.

29:54.840 --> 29:57.280
They're not aiming to solve
the problems in Chang'an.

29:57.360 --> 29:58.280
They're aiming to deal with you.

30:00.440 --> 30:02.360
Then we need to come back and take a look.

30:03.960 --> 30:06.920
Yang Jinglan, do you want to repeat
the mistakes I made back then?

30:08.120 --> 30:09.320
Yang Jingshan,

30:09.400 --> 30:11.120
my wife came here today

30:11.200 --> 30:13.560
to help the Yang family out of trouble.

30:13.640 --> 30:16.720
Besides, when has the Yang family
ever controlled me?

30:17.320 --> 30:19.080
Dear, let's go.

30:46.160 --> 30:47.000
Dear,

30:47.520 --> 30:48.720
stay calm.

30:49.640 --> 30:51.040
Ji Yingying,

30:51.880 --> 30:54.360
before the family discipline, kneel down!

30:55.080 --> 30:56.680
Second Uncle,
if you want to enforce family discipline,

30:56.760 --> 30:58.360
there needs to be a reason.

30:58.440 --> 30:59.640
A reason?

31:00.320 --> 31:02.080
You provoked the Zhao family,

31:02.800 --> 31:05.400
and now Zhao Xiuyuan has ruined

31:05.480 --> 31:07.280
our reputation in Chang'an,

31:07.360 --> 31:10.720
causing so much of our goods
to pile up unsold

31:10.800 --> 31:12.440
and our connections to be damaged.

31:12.520 --> 31:14.200
Isn't this crime enough

31:14.720 --> 31:17.200
to expel you from the Yang family?

31:17.800 --> 31:19.640
You couldn't sell your goods,

31:19.720 --> 31:20.840
but you blamed others for it.

31:21.800 --> 31:24.520
Is this how the Yang family's discipline
has turned you all into?

31:24.600 --> 31:26.120
In my view,

31:26.200 --> 31:28.000
the Yang family's discipline is worthless!

31:31.200 --> 31:32.440
Yang Jinglan!

31:33.240 --> 31:34.840
Don't talk nonsense here.

31:34.920 --> 31:37.120
If you look down on the family discipline,

31:37.200 --> 31:38.800
I'll expel you from the Yang family too,

31:39.400 --> 31:41.960
and also remove
your mother's ancestral tablet

31:42.040 --> 31:44.120
from the ancestral hall!

31:44.720 --> 31:46.920
Master, stay calm.

31:47.520 --> 31:49.000
Since it's come to this,

31:49.920 --> 31:51.160
I can't do anything about it.

31:53.640 --> 31:54.480
Yang Juli,

31:55.640 --> 31:58.440
the thing I hate most is when someone
uses my mother to threaten me.

31:59.120 --> 32:01.880
Today, I'm making it clear here.

32:02.800 --> 32:04.800
If anyone dares
to touch my mother's tablet,

32:04.880 --> 32:07.720
I'll make them apologize
to my mother face to face!

32:11.760 --> 32:13.520
Dear, do you think this will work?

32:13.600 --> 32:14.520
Yes.

32:14.600 --> 32:16.040
You unfilial descendant!

32:16.640 --> 32:18.680
How dare you threaten your elders?

32:18.760 --> 32:20.840
Someone, punish
this troublemaker, Ji Yingying,

32:20.920 --> 32:22.200
- according to the family discipline!
- Who dares!

32:27.640 --> 32:28.640
You…

32:32.080 --> 32:33.640
Juxian!

32:34.680 --> 32:35.680
Stop!

32:35.760 --> 32:38.000
Stop it!

32:40.880 --> 32:42.680
What position do you hold
in the Yang family?

32:44.400 --> 32:46.320
- Second.
- I'm still here!

32:47.560 --> 32:49.920
Don't interfere. Go stand aside.

32:58.600 --> 33:00.600
I failed to protect you
and your mother back then.

33:00.680 --> 33:02.000
That was my incompetence.

33:03.280 --> 33:06.440
If I can't even protect a tablet today,

33:07.200 --> 33:09.080
then what kind of family head am I?

33:09.600 --> 33:10.920
I might as well die!

33:22.560 --> 33:23.760
All the relatives,

33:24.400 --> 33:26.800
I've gathered you here today

33:26.880 --> 33:29.120
to solve the problem,

33:29.640 --> 33:30.520
not to shirk responsibility!

33:32.360 --> 33:35.080
If you have something to say, speak.

33:35.600 --> 33:37.080
If not, please leave.

33:39.560 --> 33:40.960
Did you all hear that?

33:41.800 --> 33:43.240
- Yes.
- Did you hear that?

33:43.760 --> 33:45.160
Our eldest brother has a bad temper!

33:46.040 --> 33:47.600
But he's the family head.

33:47.680 --> 33:50.360
As the second brother,
I have no right to say anything.

33:51.360 --> 33:53.040
I just feel sorry.

33:53.120 --> 33:55.720
What are we going to do

33:55.800 --> 33:58.560
with our family's reputation

33:58.640 --> 34:01.080
and all this unsold stock?

34:02.080 --> 34:02.960
Right!

34:03.840 --> 34:05.680
Yang family rule, Article 81.

34:06.200 --> 34:07.560
If the family head cannot

34:08.080 --> 34:09.280
shoulder the responsibility,

34:09.800 --> 34:10.960
then a resolution may be made
to relieve him.

34:11.040 --> 34:13.520
- Right.
- Seems like there is such a rule.

34:13.600 --> 34:15.120
- Nonsense!
- Master.

34:17.920 --> 34:19.440
The family head hasn't said

34:19.520 --> 34:22.199
he won't handle the troubles in Chang'an.

34:22.280 --> 34:25.520
And now, you're just taking advantage
of the situation.

34:25.600 --> 34:27.400
Will this sound good if it spreads?

34:28.000 --> 34:29.840
My own brothers probably won't

34:29.920 --> 34:33.239
want to have any dealings
with a family like this.

34:33.320 --> 34:34.679
Family head,

34:35.480 --> 34:37.400
how do you plan to manage this?

34:40.040 --> 34:42.120
Didn't Jinglin already
go to Chang'an to mediate?

34:43.440 --> 34:46.199
Tomorrow, I'll go there with Jingshan too.

34:46.280 --> 34:47.719
As long as the connections are there,

34:47.800 --> 34:49.760
the reputation
will be restored eventually.

34:49.840 --> 34:52.199
It's easy to ruin a reputation,

34:52.280 --> 34:53.320
but it's hard to rebuild it!

34:53.400 --> 34:54.840
Exactly.

34:54.920 --> 34:56.639
Right now, the most urgent matter

34:57.280 --> 34:59.480
is what to do with this batch of goods
we just finished.

34:59.560 --> 35:00.440
What should we do?

35:00.520 --> 35:01.800
I owe money outside.

35:01.880 --> 35:04.440
I'm counting on selling this batch
to clear the debts!

35:04.520 --> 35:06.160
I see, the family head

35:06.240 --> 35:07.200
can no longer manage this.

35:07.280 --> 35:08.120
That's right.

35:08.200 --> 35:09.360
Who said that?

35:13.320 --> 35:14.440
The family head has ordered me

35:14.520 --> 35:17.680
to sell this brocade
without losing a single coin.

35:17.760 --> 35:19.080
What? Sell it?

35:19.160 --> 35:20.480
Sell it?

35:21.080 --> 35:23.880
- Sell it where?
- There's no need for you to worry.

35:23.960 --> 35:26.000
According to the rules,
we'll first take a deposit,

35:26.080 --> 35:27.840
and the remaining amount will be paid
in two months.

35:30.600 --> 35:31.640
Jingshan,

35:32.440 --> 35:35.480
take the relatives to collect the deposit.

35:35.560 --> 35:36.680
Yes.

35:36.760 --> 35:38.560
Everyone, this way, please.

35:38.640 --> 35:40.760
No, wait!

35:40.840 --> 35:42.520
This is clearly just a stalling tactic!

35:42.600 --> 35:45.360
Ji Yingying is full of tricks

35:45.440 --> 35:46.520
and poison behind the scenes.

35:46.600 --> 35:47.640
You still believe her?

35:48.240 --> 35:49.160
Yang Juli!

35:53.240 --> 35:55.320
Her words are my words.

35:55.400 --> 35:57.400
If you're selling,

35:57.480 --> 35:58.760
go collect the deposit.

35:58.840 --> 36:00.280
If not, get out!

36:00.360 --> 36:02.400
I don't have time for your nonsense.

36:03.680 --> 36:04.720
Fine!

36:04.800 --> 36:06.960
You're the eldest brother.
I'll listen to you.

36:07.040 --> 36:10.320
But if the remaining payment
isn't received in two months,

36:10.400 --> 36:12.640
who will take responsibility?

36:12.720 --> 36:13.560
Right.

36:15.040 --> 36:16.520
Naturally,
the family head will be responsible!

36:18.240 --> 36:19.400
- Did you all hear that?
- Yes.

36:19.480 --> 36:21.120
- Heard it.
- Did you hear that?

36:21.840 --> 36:23.440
Those who contribute to the Yang family

36:24.240 --> 36:26.080
are never treated unfairly.

36:29.480 --> 36:32.640
Yingying, if this succeeds,

36:33.440 --> 36:35.400
you'll have a seat

36:35.480 --> 36:36.720
in the council hall.

36:40.120 --> 36:40.960
It's settled!

36:41.760 --> 36:42.600
Fine.

36:43.440 --> 36:45.400
Jingshan, take me to collect the deposit.

36:45.480 --> 36:46.720
- Let's go get the money!
- This way.

36:46.800 --> 36:47.720
Let's go!

36:55.440 --> 36:56.280
Yingying,

36:56.800 --> 36:58.840
you've always planned carefully
before taking action.

36:59.360 --> 37:01.120
Since you've spoken up today,

37:01.200 --> 37:03.400
do you really have a solution?

37:04.840 --> 37:07.640
Thank you, Sir, Madam,
for trusting and supporting me.

37:08.640 --> 37:10.160
I do indeed have an idea.

37:11.360 --> 37:13.120
I want to leverage
Yizhou's geographic advantage

37:13.200 --> 37:14.880
to open foreign trade routes

37:14.960 --> 37:15.920
and truly break the stalemate.

37:16.560 --> 37:18.040
Open trade routes?

37:19.200 --> 37:21.200
Since the nobles of Chang'an

37:21.280 --> 37:22.240
are temporarily blinded,

37:22.320 --> 37:25.040
we might as well
sell the brocade elsewhere.

37:25.760 --> 37:28.280
Let them see,
no matter how much they slander us,

37:28.360 --> 37:31.560
our Yang family's brocade
will always be worth its weight in gold.

37:32.280 --> 37:33.280
Moreover,

37:33.800 --> 37:35.080
if the trade routes are opened,

37:35.160 --> 37:37.120
not only can this batch of brocade
be sold,

37:37.200 --> 37:39.320
but more orders will come in,

37:39.400 --> 37:41.080
truly opening up Yang family's market.

37:42.600 --> 37:46.240
It's true that foreigners
also love Shu brocade,

37:46.800 --> 37:50.960
but the foreign business we know

37:51.480 --> 37:52.840
has already been divided up.

37:54.240 --> 37:57.240
That's why we need to take a path
no one has taken before.

37:58.720 --> 38:01.160
Starting from Yizhou,
heading southwest to Tibet,

38:01.240 --> 38:03.280
sacred lands and hidden realms
are everywhere.

38:03.360 --> 38:04.520
All are business opportunities.

38:05.200 --> 38:07.560
No. You can't go.

38:07.640 --> 38:09.600
That route is extremely dangerous,

38:09.680 --> 38:11.560
plagued by natural disasters
and human threats.

38:12.080 --> 38:13.400
You can't go.

38:13.480 --> 38:16.400
It's fine. I'll go with her.
I'll make sure she's safe.

38:17.200 --> 38:19.000
So, it'll be safe
just because you're going?

38:19.520 --> 38:20.920
Are you a deity?

38:21.000 --> 38:22.840
Or can you carve out roads from mountains?

38:27.080 --> 38:29.320
Don't you know people in Chang'an?

38:29.840 --> 38:31.200
Sell the goods to them.

38:31.280 --> 38:32.600
Bring the brocade

38:32.680 --> 38:34.360
and go to Chang'an with me.

38:35.360 --> 38:36.200
Sir,

38:36.800 --> 38:39.560
the brocade can be sold no matter what,

38:40.080 --> 38:41.920
but restoring the Yang family's reputation

38:42.000 --> 38:43.320
cannot be achieved overnight.

38:44.760 --> 38:46.280
By opening trade routes

38:46.360 --> 38:47.840
from the outside,

38:47.920 --> 38:50.160
the Yang family's reputation
will also be restored.

38:54.880 --> 38:56.480
This is the best

38:57.720 --> 38:59.080
and the only way for our family.

39:04.880 --> 39:07.200
Whether it works or not,
we must give it a try.

39:10.200 --> 39:13.240
In your eyes,
is business more important than life?

39:15.120 --> 39:16.800
I have no other talents.

39:17.320 --> 39:19.000
Only by succeeding in business

39:19.080 --> 39:20.640
can I protect the people I care about,

39:20.720 --> 39:22.800
so they can live long and worry-free.

39:26.360 --> 39:28.560
Yingying has always dared to lead the way.

39:28.640 --> 39:29.520
I trust her,

39:30.960 --> 39:33.680
and I trust Jinglan to protect her.

39:33.760 --> 39:36.840
This isn't as simple as you make it sound.

39:36.920 --> 39:38.280
Don't worry, Father.

39:38.360 --> 39:39.720
How can I not worry…

39:43.520 --> 39:45.080
What did you just call me?

39:45.800 --> 39:46.640
What did you call me?

39:46.720 --> 39:47.800
If you didn't hear, forget it.

39:48.880 --> 39:51.480
No, I heard!

39:51.560 --> 39:53.800
Can't you say it again?

39:57.240 --> 39:58.640
You'd better

39:58.720 --> 40:00.480
bring her back in one piece.

40:00.560 --> 40:03.680
Otherwise, I'll break your legs.

40:04.200 --> 40:06.080
You're rambling. Don't worry.

40:10.240 --> 40:11.120
Fine.

40:11.640 --> 40:13.560
Then, let's each prepare.

40:13.640 --> 40:16.080
I'll go to Chang'an with Jingshan.

40:16.720 --> 40:18.440
I'll stay in Yizhou to mediate.

40:18.520 --> 40:20.480
I'll prepare the map
and documents with Jinglan.

40:21.080 --> 40:21.960
Alright.

40:22.040 --> 40:23.120
Remember,

40:23.960 --> 40:25.040
safety comes first.

40:34.920 --> 40:37.800
YUEBUHUAN INN

40:53.840 --> 40:54.800
How come you're so exhausted?

40:55.680 --> 40:57.520
Did the Yang family force you into labor?

41:04.800 --> 41:06.560
I've been gathering information
about the trade routes.

41:07.680 --> 41:09.640
My mouth is almost worn out,

41:09.720 --> 41:11.080
and my legs are nearly broken.

41:11.680 --> 41:13.000
Gathering information about trade routes?

41:13.560 --> 41:14.800
Where are you planning to go?

41:16.240 --> 41:19.200
I want to sell the Yang's brocade
to foreign lands.

41:20.120 --> 41:22.640
But the southwestern frontier
is thinly populated,

41:23.400 --> 41:25.680
and detailed maps are even rarer.

41:26.800 --> 41:28.160
I've searched for days,

41:28.240 --> 41:30.560
and the most detailed one I found
is this map.

41:30.640 --> 41:32.160
Here, take a look.

41:33.480 --> 41:36.000
Starting from Yizhou,
follow the official road,

41:36.080 --> 41:37.440
pass through this dense forest,

41:37.520 --> 41:39.960
and keep going, but there's no road ahead.

41:40.720 --> 41:41.760
I've asked every caravan,

41:41.840 --> 41:45.320
and no one can tell me exactly
how to proceed.

41:46.680 --> 41:48.000
Never mind going forward,

41:48.520 --> 41:50.800
the road through this forest is tricky,

41:50.880 --> 41:52.760
full of marshes, very hard to travel.

41:53.680 --> 41:55.120
That doesn't mean impossible.

41:55.720 --> 41:59.240
If the road has been mapped out,
it means it can be traveled.

41:59.320 --> 42:03.400
The key right now
is this place with no road.

42:04.800 --> 42:06.320
Your family used to lead caravans.

42:06.400 --> 42:09.080
Can you help me figure out
which way we should take?

42:09.160 --> 42:11.240
Should we go by mountain road
or by waterway?

42:11.840 --> 42:13.480
The water is swift,
and the mountain path is perilous.

42:13.560 --> 42:14.560
Both are bad.

42:15.720 --> 42:17.960
What if we go around this way?

42:21.120 --> 42:22.920
This area is flat,

42:23.440 --> 42:24.960
but full of bandits.

42:25.040 --> 42:26.280
One slip,

42:26.360 --> 42:27.560
and you lose both people and goods.

42:29.320 --> 42:30.600
You really are an expert.

42:30.680 --> 42:31.840
You know everything.

42:32.520 --> 42:34.040
Now, help me figure out a way,

42:34.120 --> 42:35.160
expert.

42:38.600 --> 42:40.640
Opening trade routes
can be very profitable.

42:40.720 --> 42:42.360
But if it were easy,

42:42.440 --> 42:43.640
people would rush in.

42:43.720 --> 42:45.280
You wouldn't get a chance.

42:46.120 --> 42:47.240
This route is so difficult,

42:48.280 --> 42:50.520
even experienced traders
wouldn't dare try it.

42:51.520 --> 42:52.360
Yingying,

42:52.440 --> 42:54.240
if you really
want to help the Yang family,

42:54.320 --> 42:56.600
you can think of another way.

42:57.120 --> 42:58.600
This route is really hard.

42:59.680 --> 43:01.600
What other way could I possibly have?

43:04.160 --> 43:05.840
I know this route is hard,

43:06.360 --> 43:09.040
but the Yang family's situation
is also critical.

43:09.120 --> 43:10.080
I can't ignore it.
